(5617045, 814510, 107410, '<td valign="top">Sharp with a nicely shallow DOF, but it just doesn''t speak to me. 6</td>', 'Sharp with a nicely shallow DOF, but it just doesn''t speak to me. 6', '2009-08-19 13:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617088, 814794, 107410, '<td valign="top">I love this POV, it makes me feel like I''m looking at the tallest pitcher ever. I can see this being a really powerful image if it had a red backdrop (but still retained the reflection of the sky).</td>', 'I love this POV, it makes me feel like I''m looking at the tallest pitcher ever. I can see this being a really powerful image if it had a red backdrop (but still retained the reflection of the sky).', '2009-08-19 14:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617091, 813988, 100335, '<td valign="top">Was this using a lensbaby? Interesting image I like how the focus directs you to the center of the image. The cuves in the background was a good call it clarifies the setting. I am betting you will get voted down for stretching the challenge concept since this really isn''t a household appliance.</td>', 'Was this using a lensbaby? Interesting image I like how the focus directs you to the center of the image. The cuves in the background was a good call it clarifies the setting. I am betting you will get voted down for stretching the challenge concept since this really isn''t a household appliance.', '2009-08-19 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617094, 814930, 107410, '<td valign="top">It''s sharp and contrasty, but seems kinda lifeless. Did you consider grinding up the coffee and adding some motion into the shot?</td>', 'It''s sharp and contrasty, but seems kinda lifeless. Did you consider grinding up the coffee and adding some motion into the shot?', '2009-08-19 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617096, 813536, 108584, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh', '2009-08-19 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617098, 814921, 108584, '<td valign="top">Loved the idea, but unfortunatley the shot is out of focus</td>', 'Loved the idea, but unfortunatley the shot is out of focus', '2009-08-19 14:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617110, 814871, 107410, '<td valign="top">Yes it is. Nice snapshot.<br/> <br/>-5 for owning a GE product.</td>', 'Yes it is. Nice snapshot. -5 for owning a GE product.', '2009-08-19 14:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617123, 814772, 107410, '<td valign="top">Points for gumption, but as an image, it seems to be lacking contrast and punch. Plus the flash reflection on the window is distracting (if that''s even possible).</td>', 'Points for gumption, but as an image, it seems to be lacking contrast and punch. Plus the flash reflection on the window is distracting (if that''s even possible).', '2009-08-19 14:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617150, 814796, 107410, '<td valign="top">Interesting take, but it seems like the focus on the blades is slightly off.</td>', 'Interesting take, but it seems like the focus on the blades is slightly off.', '2009-08-19 14:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617173, 813662, 37252, '<td valign="top">A bit too abstract to clearly identify the appliance without the title. The inside being so dark, perhaps you could have used fill light to help show off details of your coffee maker.</td>', 'A bit too abstract to clearly identify the appliance without the title. The inside being so dark, perhaps you could have used fill light to help show off details of your coffee maker.', '2009-08-19 14:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617174, 814940, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good DoF and angle of composition made this rather neglected part of the refrigerator interesting.</td>', 'Good DoF and angle of composition made this rather neglected part of the refrigerator interesting.', '2009-08-19 14:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617178, 814955, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice clean microwave. I think for the challenge I would have liked the microwave to be your subject rather than the milk, as this is what I am drawn to.</td>', 'Nice clean microwave. I think for the challenge I would have liked the microwave to be your subject rather than the milk, as this is what I am drawn to.', '2009-08-19 14:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617181, 814959, 10785, '<td valign="top">This image generates energy with the stop motion capture. It has such a wow factor to it. It''s a 10!</td>', 'This image generates energy with the stop motion capture. It has such a wow factor to it. It''s a 10!', '2009-08-19 14:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617187, 814705, 37252, '<td valign="top">While your title makes this earth friendly, when I look at the image I think of pollution - a vacuum discarded in a field. As for the technicals, perhaps some adjustments in shadows/highlights or in contrast would have given this shot a boost.</td>', 'While your title makes this earth friendly, when I look at the image I think of pollution - a vacuum discarded in a field. As for the technicals, perhaps some adjustments in shadows/highlights or in contrast would have given this shot a boost.', '2009-08-19 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617193, 814951, 59276, '<td valign="top">your nice close crop and angle is ribbon winning! nice touch of B&amp;W</td>', 'your nice close crop and angle is ribbon winning! nice touch of B&W', '2009-08-19 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617225, 814747, 22914, '<td valign="top">beautiful.........</td>', 'beautiful.........', '2009-08-19 15:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
