(5617553, 814805, 108351, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, it kept me looking for a while. The colors are nice too... then I saw the overexposed face and realized you must be really small to hide inside the dryer.</td>', 'Nice perspective, it kept me looking for a while. The colors are nice too... then I saw the overexposed face and realized you must be really small to hide inside the dryer.', '2009-08-19 21:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
