(5617639, 814940, 107410, '<td valign="top">I like the low "mouse''s eye view." The only difference that I would''ve made is to tidy up the items in the background since the lines of "that thing at the bottom" lead the eye right to them.</td>', 'I like the low "mouse''s eye view." The only difference that I would''ve made is to tidy up the items in the background since the lines of "that thing at the bottom" lead the eye right to them.', '2009-08-19 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617646, 814726, 107410, '<td valign="top">This shot just doesn''t speak to me in any meaningful way. Did you consider taking a shot from the side and using a shallow DOF to selectively focus on the jar with the silver cap?</td>', 'This shot just doesn''t speak to me in any meaningful way. Did you consider taking a shot from the side and using a shallow DOF to selectively focus on the jar with the silver cap?', '2009-08-19 22:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
