(5617800, 814871, 62357, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a household appliance that''s for sure, but it lacks a bit in the creativity part of the challenge description.</td>', 'Well, it''s a household appliance that''s for sure, but it lacks a bit in the creativity part of the challenge description.', '2009-08-20 00:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
