(5617819, 814190, 103601, '<td valign="top">coors light, natty, and a stray rolling rock or something and NO OTHER FOOD??? hahahahaha i love it. is that a giant jar of pickles? dude, you get a 10. i''m pretty sure you needed to grab a few beers for a game of beer pong and took this shot on the way :)</td>', 'coors light, natty, and a stray rolling rock or something and NO OTHER FOOD??? hahahahaha i love it. is that a giant jar of pickles? dude, you get a 10. i''m pretty sure you needed to grab a few beers for a game of beer pong and took this shot on the way :)', '2009-08-20 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5617853, 814948, 37845, '<td valign="top">I''m going to be honest, I gave this shot a 3. The reason why is that I feel it is a shoehorn image. The only thing that remotely suggests appliances is the title.</td>', 'I''m going to be honest, I gave this shot a 3. The reason why is that I feel it is a shoehorn image. The only thing that remotely suggests appliances is the title.', '2009-08-20 01:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
