(5619521, 814853, 91496, '<td valign="top">Lighting is both interesting and bit distracting.  Might have a few too many objects.</td>', 'Lighting is both interesting and bit distracting.  Might have a few too many objects.', '2009-08-21 17:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619523, 813998, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very nice, with good use of DOF and interesting lines in the composition. The blue border is not too my liking as it is distracting.</td>', 'Very nice, with good use of DOF and interesting lines in the composition. The blue border is not too my liking as it is distracting.', '2009-08-21 17:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619524, 813991, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the right hand side with arms and the fruit.  The left hand side is kind of weak with washed (pun unintended) colors.  Perhaps a square crop of the left hand side would ahve more impact.</td>', 'I like the right hand side with arms and the fruit.  The left hand side is kind of weak with washed (pun unintended) colors.  Perhaps a square crop of the left hand side would ahve more impact.', '2009-08-21 17:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619525, 813988, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wild photo, with a cool keyhole effect.  I suppose a lot of that junk was an appliance once, but it is an obvious connection.  I like the wall-e reference.</td>', 'Wild photo, with a cool keyhole effect.  I suppose a lot of that junk was an appliance once, but it is an obvious connection.  I like the wall-e reference.', '2009-08-21 17:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619528, 814126, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a relection.  Colors seem a tad oversatured and they certainly dominate the compostition.</td>', 'Nice use of a relection.  Colors seem a tad oversatured and they certainly dominate the compostition.', '2009-08-21 17:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619529, 814726, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping, with the thin layer of the shelf.  I think most appliances are device, usually running on electricity.</td>', 'I like the cropping, with the thin layer of the shelf.  I think most appliances are device, usually running on electricity.', '2009-08-21 17:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619530, 813662, 91496, '<td valign="top">Well I can see what you are trying for here with the odd angle and the stark lighting.  I am not should that I find it visually appealing though.</td>', 'Well I can see what you are trying for here with the odd angle and the stark lighting.  I am not should that I find it visually appealing though.', '2009-08-21 17:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619531, 814064, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the top and bottom.  I like all the textures.  Probably going to get hammered in voting (not sharp/pretty).  Too bad.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the top and bottom.  I like all the textures.  Probably going to get hammered in voting (not sharp/pretty).  Too bad.', '2009-08-21 17:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619532, 814796, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool viewpoint.  Great use of DOF.  Crop might be too tight on the sides, give it more room to breath or even move in tighter.</td>', 'Cool viewpoint.  Great use of DOF.  Crop might be too tight on the sides, give it more room to breath or even move in tighter.', '2009-08-21 17:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619533, 814794, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool viewpoint.  I like the composition a lot with the nice curves.  Not sure the lettering adds much</td>', 'Cool viewpoint.  I like the composition a lot with the nice curves.  Not sure the lettering adds much', '2009-08-21 17:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619534, 814800, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the blue cup.  The appliance theme is kind of indirect as the cup and the coffe are really the subjects of this one.</td>', 'Nice framing of the blue cup.  The appliance theme is kind of indirect as the cup and the coffe are really the subjects of this one.', '2009-08-21 17:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619536, 814705, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like how the handle curves towards the middle.  Colors are a little washed out.  I have mixed feeling on the sun''s flare.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like how the handle curves towards the middle.  Colors are a little washed out.  I have mixed feeling on the sun''s flare.', '2009-08-21 17:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619538, 814820, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  I like how it is harsher than a normal product shot.  It gives it some pop.  Best title I have seen in a long time.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  I like how it is harsher than a normal product shot.  It gives it some pop.  Best title I have seen in a long time.', '2009-08-21 17:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619539, 814723, 91496, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for here with the extreme angle, but the contrast between the reddish ground and the blown out sky does not work for me.  The rsty textures are cool.</td>', 'I see what you were going for here with the extreme angle, but the contrast between the reddish ground and the blown out sky does not work for me.  The rsty textures are cool.', '2009-08-21 17:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619542, 814079, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice view point and use of DOF.  I like all the metallics details.  Not sure if cutting off the bottom work for me.  I think you need to either crop off more or show the whole thing.</td>', 'Nice view point and use of DOF.  I like all the metallics details.  Not sure if cutting off the bottom work for me.  I think you need to either crop off more or show the whole thing.', '2009-08-21 17:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619547, 814735, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge, kind of like a barefoot entry in the footwear challenge.  Will be DNMC to some.  I like all the lines and curves in the composition.  Not sure the angle or the DOF works for me.  May have been more interesting to zoom in on one subject more.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge, kind of like a barefoot entry in the footwear challenge.  Will be DNMC to some.  I like all the lines and curves in the composition.  Not sure the angle or the DOF works for me.  May have been more interesting to zoom in on one subject more.', '2009-08-21 17:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619549, 814805, 91496, '<td valign="top">First impression is wow as the colors and the metal contrast so nicely.  Second impression is confusion, as in why is the inside of a dryer so brightly lit.  Photo still works on many levels.  Bravo.</td>', 'First impression is wow as the colors and the metal contrast so nicely.  Second impression is confusion, as in why is the inside of a dryer so brightly lit.  Photo still works on many levels.  Bravo.', '2009-08-21 17:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619560, 814215, 57447, '<td valign="top">Not enough detail but nice focus and reflection.</td>', 'Not enough detail but nice focus and reflection.', '2009-08-21 17:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619594, 813642, 86799, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is.  But it''s a very snap-shot type picture.  Needs some better sharpness, focus, steadiness, some composition that would grab interest.</td>', 'Yes, it is.  But it''s a very snap-shot type picture.  Needs some better sharpness, focus, steadiness, some composition that would grab interest.', '2009-08-21 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619600, 814551, 86799, '<td valign="top">Don''t see any "appliance" here.  DNMC, but it is still a nice pic, just can''t score it very high.</td>', 'Don''t see any "appliance" here.  DNMC, but it is still a nice pic, just can''t score it very high.', '2009-08-21 18:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619602, 814772, 86799, '<td valign="top">NOT what I needed to see.  LOL.  OK pic though.</td>', 'NOT what I needed to see.  LOL.  OK pic though.', '2009-08-21 18:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619606, 814908, 86799, '<td valign="top">Clever title, O.K. pic.  If you had lined up dead center your sides would have been square.  The off-vertical lines are a bit distracting.  Maybe a few more socks to make the point.  Nice idea.</td>', 'Clever title, O.K. pic.  If you had lined up dead center your sides would have been square.  The off-vertical lines are a bit distracting.  Maybe a few more socks to make the point.  Nice idea.', '2009-08-21 18:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619607, 814882, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract feel to it.</td>', 'Nice abstract feel to it.', '2009-08-21 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619608, 813991, 86799, '<td valign="top">Something original and different!!!  Yay!  Kinda kooky, but it deserves some attention.  And it''s not a stove coil.  And it bright, sharp and clear!</td>', 'Something original and different!!!  Yay!  Kinda kooky, but it deserves some attention.  And it''s not a stove coil.  And it bright, sharp and clear!', '2009-08-21 18:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
