(5619744, 814908, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the centered compositions and the B&amp;W treatment.  Not sure I like the positions of the socks, although I can not put my finger on why.  Title might be a little wordy.</td>', 'I like the centered compositions and the B&W treatment.  Not sure I like the positions of the socks, although I can not put my finger on why.  Title might be a little wordy.', '2009-08-21 21:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
