(5619746, 814191, 91496, '<td valign="top">What a bad pun -- shame on you :)  I like all the wood grain as it is kind of unique in a product shot.  Lighting is a bit harsh.  I find that hiding the cord behind the subject give a cleaner look.</td>', 'What a bad pun -- shame on you :)  I like all the wood grain as it is kind of unique in a product shot.  Lighting is a bit harsh.  I find that hiding the cord behind the subject give a cleaner look.', '2009-08-21 21:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
