(5619825, 814190, 107410, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that you''re single...<br/> <br/>But seriously, the dark door and the blurred background make the image hold too much tension for me. I wonder if it''s so close to "real" yet so unnatural that my eyes don''t want to accept it. I''m not sure though.</td>', 'I''m guessing that you''re single... But seriously, the dark door and the blurred background make the image hold too much tension for me. I wonder if it''s so close to "real" yet so unnatural that my eyes don''t want to accept it. I''m not sure though.', '2009-08-22 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
