(5619845, 814959, 103142, '<td valign="top">Do you mind? I mean really. Just because many of us did blender shots, doesn''t mean that you had to do the best one! Fine. Show us all up--see what we care!  <br/> <br/>*sniff* *sob*<br/> <br/>Spectacular shot. (I''m jealous about the blender, as well...) - 9</td>', 'Do you mind? I mean really. Just because many of us did blender shots, doesn''t mean that you had to do the best one! Fine. Show us all up--see what we care!   *sniff* *sob* Spectacular shot. (I''m jealous about the blender, as well...) - 9', '2009-08-22 00:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619846, 814497, 103142, '<td valign="top">Rif? sorry -- don''t get the title. I looked it up, and all I found was "reading is fundamental".<br/> <br/>I like this very much. I like the old photograph feel of the processing. Nice job. 7</td>', 'Rif? sorry -- don''t get the title. I looked it up, and all I found was "reading is fundamental". I like this very much. I like the old photograph feel of the processing. Nice job. 7', '2009-08-22 00:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619848, 813998, 103142, '<td valign="top">The very shallow depth of field on the needle is very distracting (imo). It doesn''t work well for me, because it''s a strange setup. The hand sewing needle and the lack of needle on the machine doesn''t make a lot of sense in the still life, because they really don''t go together (unless the needle is there because the sewing machine doesn''t work anymore). It was a good effort, though. (last thing--I think the picture would be much stronger without the border. I don''t vote on borders, but some people do...)  5</td>', 'The very shallow depth of field on the needle is very distracting (imo). It doesn''t work well for me, because it''s a strange setup. The hand sewing needle and the lack of needle on the machine doesn''t make a lot of sense in the still life, because they really don''t go together (unless the needle is there because the sewing machine doesn''t work anymore). It was a good effort, though. (last thing--I think the picture would be much stronger without the border. I don''t vote on borders, but some people do...)  5', '2009-08-22 01:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619849, 813662, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the colors. But if they pot is empty, it''s very hard to tell on my screen. Nice idea, but not quite there in my mind -- 5</td>', 'I like the angle and the colors. But if they pot is empty, it''s very hard to tell on my screen. Nice idea, but not quite there in my mind -- 5', '2009-08-22 01:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619850, 814279, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but it''s quite there, imo. The swoop of brushes in the middle two squares is actually quite interesting. If you had moved the shot over a tad to the right and gotten the start of the next swoop, it might have been more interesting.<br/> <br/>Also, usually the rollers are pretty black, did you try playing with the levels to get a little more contrast? 5</td>', 'I really like the idea, but it''s quite there, imo. The swoop of brushes in the middle two squares is actually quite interesting. If you had moved the shot over a tad to the right and gotten the start of the next swoop, it might have been more interesting. Also, usually the rollers are pretty black, did you try playing with the levels to get a little more contrast? 5', '2009-08-22 01:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619851, 814272, 103142, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the inner border. I think it would be stronger without it. I do like the chaos and the angle, however! Seems a tad pale. Did you play a little more contrast? I''d be curious if more contrast would hurt or help the photo...</td>', 'I don''t care for the inner border. I think it would be stronger without it. I do like the chaos and the angle, however! Seems a tad pale. Did you play a little more contrast? I''d be curious if more contrast would hurt or help the photo...', '2009-08-22 01:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619852, 814723, 103142, '<td valign="top">interesting idea. Your colors seem to be rather oversaturated. Undersaturating, or even b&amp;w with sepia might give it an even more "used up" feel.</td>', 'interesting idea. Your colors seem to be rather oversaturated. Undersaturating, or even b&w with sepia might give it an even more "used up" feel.', '2009-08-22 01:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619854, 814948, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the humor, but I''m sorry, I just can''t see a cat fitting my definition of an appliance: "A device or instrument designed to perform a specific function, especially an electrical device, such as a toaster, for household use." and even though he/she certainly performs a specific function, it''s just not a device or instrument.  Sorry!</td>', 'I like the humor, but I''m sorry, I just can''t see a cat fitting my definition of an appliance: "A device or instrument designed to perform a specific function, especially an electrical device, such as a toaster, for household use." and even though he/she certainly performs a specific function, it''s just not a device or instrument.  Sorry!', '2009-08-22 01:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619855, 814568, 103142, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2009-08-22 01:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619857, 814940, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I''m finding the things on the left hand side of the picture to be distracting. Maybe if you had desaturated the reds and blues (cyans?) it might have helped.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I''m finding the things on the left hand side of the picture to be distracting. Maybe if you had desaturated the reds and blues (cyans?) it might have helped.', '2009-08-22 01:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619858, 814871, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but not very interesting, imo. Maybe if it was in the process of filtering, it might have added some interest?</td>', 'Nice shot, but not very interesting, imo. Maybe if it was in the process of filtering, it might have added some interest?', '2009-08-22 01:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619859, 814882, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is actually quite cool! Though it freaks my eyes out looking at it. I think you''ll get hit because of the pixelation on the right. (I don''t mind it, but it drives my husband batty when my photos are like that...) 7</td>', 'This is actually quite cool! Though it freaks my eyes out looking at it. I think you''ll get hit because of the pixelation on the right. (I don''t mind it, but it drives my husband batty when my photos are like that...) 7', '2009-08-22 01:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619860, 814126, 103142, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea, but it''s very hard to tell that it''s a television. Perhaps a different angle would have kept the reflection, but still have given the appliance a little more of the spotlight. (also the toys in the background are distracting. But I like the block rug!)</td>', 'I do like the idea, but it''s very hard to tell that it''s a television. Perhaps a different angle would have kept the reflection, but still have given the appliance a little more of the spotlight. (also the toys in the background are distracting. But I like the block rug!)', '2009-08-22 01:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619861, 814908, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! My husband greatly appreciated the title, as well. (he''s a physicist.)</td>', 'Nice shot! My husband greatly appreciated the title, as well. (he''s a physicist.)', '2009-08-22 01:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619862, 814163, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the shot very much. There''s only two things that detract from it: the lines in the upper left corner (end of counter?) and the cord so out of focus at the end. The reflection on the toaster is fascinating. With a little more depth of field and slid over more on the counter, I would have given it a 7 or an 8.  As it is: 6</td>', 'I like the shot very much. There''s only two things that detract from it: the lines in the upper left corner (end of counter?) and the cord so out of focus at the end. The reflection on the toaster is fascinating. With a little more depth of field and slid over more on the counter, I would have given it a 7 or an 8.  As it is: 6', '2009-08-22 01:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619867, 814853, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. I like the silver of the sink and the silver of the fish. I would have liked a tad less room on the left and a small amount more on the right. (this fish seem rather crowded, imo). I know it''s nit-picking, but I really like the photo. 7</td>', 'Very interesting shot. I like the silver of the sink and the silver of the fish. I would have liked a tad less room on the left and a small amount more on the right. (this fish seem rather crowded, imo). I know it''s nit-picking, but I really like the photo. 7', '2009-08-22 01:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619868, 814805, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot!</td>', 'Very interesting shot!', '2009-08-22 01:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619878, 814805, 103032, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Like the patterns and lines and the "coldness" of the metal on the left, which then is balanced by the colors and the "softness" of the clothes.  Also like the "blown" face; like that only the very most basic elements of the face are there.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  Very cool abstract qualities to it.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Like the patterns and lines and the "coldness" of the metal on the left, which then is balanced by the colors and the "softness" of the clothes.  Also like the "blown" face; like that only the very most basic elements of the face are there.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  Very cool abstract qualities to it.', '2009-08-22 02:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619880, 814714, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like your choice to go B&amp;W.  Great framing.  It''s "busy" with all the dishes, cups, pots, etc, but yet very simple and it is what it is, a dishwasher.  Nice job.</td>', 'Like your choice to go B&W.  Great framing.  It''s "busy" with all the dishes, cups, pots, etc, but yet very simple and it is what it is, a dishwasher.  Nice job.', '2009-08-22 02:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619884, 814215, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very cool sci-fi space helmet looking image.  Like the almost totally silhouetted vac.  Like the reflection.  I''m guessing you worked the hose to get it just right for this shot which adds to the space age/sci-fi feel.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very cool sci-fi space helmet looking image.  Like the almost totally silhouetted vac.  Like the reflection.  I''m guessing you worked the hose to get it just right for this shot which adds to the space age/sci-fi feel.  Nice work.', '2009-08-22 02:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619886, 814163, 103032, '<td valign="top">Cool reflection off the toaster.  I think the "spartan" counters/stove works to focus on the toaster and the reflection adds an interest of the surroundings which doesn''t distract.</td>', 'Cool reflection off the toaster.  I think the "spartan" counters/stove works to focus on the toaster and the reflection adds an interest of the surroundings which doesn''t distract.', '2009-08-22 03:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5619887, 814682, 103032, '<td valign="top">I think the vintage sewing machine would be a interesting appliance, but it blends into the dark background.  I think a lighter background that contrast with the black sewing machine would have made this a more interesting image.  IMHO.</td>', 'I think the vintage sewing machine would be a interesting appliance, but it blends into the dark background.  I think a lighter background that contrast with the black sewing machine would have made this a more interesting image.  IMHO.', '2009-08-22 03:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
