(5620106, 814154, 28359, '<td valign="top">This must had taken a ton of patience. Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'This must had taken a ton of patience. Nice take on the challenge.', '2009-08-22 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620107, 814921, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, not sure on the black background, could be a little sharper (that''s easy to say..hmm). 6</td>', 'I like the idea, not sure on the black background, could be a little sharper (that''s easy to say..hmm). 6', '2009-08-22 11:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620108, 814957, 28359, '<td valign="top">Snap me out of it...:) Reminds me of an old Star Trek original show.</td>', 'Snap me out of it...:) Reminds me of an old Star Trek original show.', '2009-08-22 11:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620109, 814272, 28359, '<td valign="top">Real life story. I like the angle, but I might try cropping it tighter up to the boarder or so, which leaves just the basket and washer pretty much ?</td>', 'Real life story. I like the angle, but I might try cropping it tighter up to the boarder or so, which leaves just the basket and washer pretty much ?', '2009-08-22 11:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620110, 814800, 28359, '<td valign="top">Good focus &amp; composition on the drop.</td>', 'Good focus & composition on the drop.', '2009-08-22 11:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620111, 814561, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like in a absract kind of way.</td>', 'I like in a absract kind of way.', '2009-08-22 11:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620112, 814820, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, clean image.</td>', 'Nice lighting, clean image.', '2009-08-22 11:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620113, 813536, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nicely put together, lighting is good, looks a litle out of focus.</td>', 'Nicely put together, lighting is good, looks a litle out of focus.', '2009-08-22 11:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620114, 814794, 28359, '<td valign="top">The only cloud in the sky is in the reflection, Cool!</td>', 'The only cloud in the sky is in the reflection, Cool!', '2009-08-22 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620115, 814853, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice tones to the image.</td>', 'Nice tones to the image.', '2009-08-22 11:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620116, 814511, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF &amp; composition.</td>', 'Nice DOF & composition.', '2009-08-22 11:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620117, 814940, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, B&amp;W was a good choice. 6</td>', 'Nice perspective, B&W was a good choice. 6', '2009-08-22 11:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620118, 813604, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like how the DOF &amp; the composition of the sharpness is composed.</td>', 'I like how the DOF & the composition of the sharpness is composed.', '2009-08-22 11:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620119, 814908, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image. Catching the sock in the air adds a ton. Not sure on the composition, yet I have no real suggestions. 6</td>', 'Nice clean image. Catching the sock in the air adds a ton. Not sure on the composition, yet I have no real suggestions. 6', '2009-08-22 11:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620120, 814510, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice shallow DOF.</td>', 'Nice shallow DOF.', '2009-08-22 11:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620121, 814106, 28359, '<td valign="top">But it''s not plugged in..Lol. Nice take on the challenge</td>', 'But it''s not plugged in..Lol. Nice take on the challenge', '2009-08-22 11:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620122, 813998, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I think the composition is off a litlle, the focus is the head of the needle resting on the arm but the crop of the image puts the focus on the bar coming down, if that makes any since. Not marking down for the boarder, I feel it''s distracting. Lighting and the background are Great.</td>', 'Nice idea, I think the composition is off a litlle, the focus is the head of the needle resting on the arm but the crop of the image puts the focus on the bar coming down, if that makes any since. Not marking down for the boarder, I feel it''s distracting. Lighting and the background are Great.', '2009-08-22 11:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620123, 814955, 28359, '<td valign="top">Great colors &amp; comp. It might be my monitor but the inside of the microwave is pretty dark. 6</td>', 'Great colors & comp. It might be my monitor but the inside of the microwave is pretty dark. 6', '2009-08-22 11:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620124, 814772, 28359, '<td valign="top">OMG....to funny!!!</td>', 'OMG....to funny!!!', '2009-08-22 11:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620125, 814568, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure &amp; color</td>', 'Nice exposure & color', '2009-08-22 11:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620126, 814959, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice action in the image.</td>', 'Nice action in the image.', '2009-08-22 11:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620127, 814882, 28359, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice lines.</td>', 'Good composition, nice lines.', '2009-08-22 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620128, 814279, 28359, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines, good use of DOF.</td>', 'Interesting lines, good use of DOF.', '2009-08-22 11:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620129, 814951, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective &amp; exposure</td>', 'Nice perspective & exposure', '2009-08-22 11:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620130, 814191, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I think a tighter shot/crop would had help a litle.</td>', 'Nice idea, I think a tighter shot/crop would had help a litle.', '2009-08-22 11:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620131, 814947, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, the little girl is cute, but I think a different background like a kitchen or bathroom with a mirror would fit a little better</td>', 'I like the idea, the little girl is cute, but I think a different background like a kitchen or bathroom with a mirror would fit a little better', '2009-08-22 11:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620132, 813475, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal composition, not sure cropping out the left  side help though</td>', 'I like the diagonal composition, not sure cropping out the left  side help though', '2009-08-22 11:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620133, 814135, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure on the background, little dark in front/face. Clean image, but to be honest if it wasn''t for the title I would had no idea if it was an appliance. (here is where a 5.5 button would help me) 5</td>', 'Nice exposure on the background, little dark in front/face. Clean image, but to be honest if it wasn''t for the title I would had no idea if it was an appliance. (here is where a 5.5 button would help me) 5', '2009-08-22 11:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620134, 813662, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective. A little busy, contrasty in the shadows, can''t really see into the pot.</td>', 'I like the perspective. A little busy, contrasty in the shadows, can''t really see into the pot.', '2009-08-22 11:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620135, 814796, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, not so sure on the center composition.</td>', 'Nice DOF, not so sure on the center composition.', '2009-08-22 11:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620136, 814731, 28359, '<td valign="top">Good clean image</td>', 'Good clean image', '2009-08-22 11:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620137, 814483, 28359, '<td valign="top">Cute shot</td>', 'Cute shot', '2009-08-22 11:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620138, 814079, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the color/subject, it''s composed well and nice DOF, but not so sure about the background.</td>', 'I like the color/subject, it''s composed well and nice DOF, but not so sure about the background.', '2009-08-22 11:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620139, 813612, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, like the open space</td>', 'Nice lighting, like the open space', '2009-08-22 11:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620140, 814929, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice composition in it self, but something missing for me, may be a different perspective. Maybe from above down wards with a twist?</td>', 'Nice composition in it self, but something missing for me, may be a different perspective. Maybe from above down wards with a twist?', '2009-08-22 11:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620141, 814856, 28359, '<td valign="top">Wild and Crazy is my first impression. Pretty busy shot.</td>', 'Wild and Crazy is my first impression. Pretty busy shot.', '2009-08-22 11:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620142, 814682, 28359, '<td valign="top">Cool old machine. Nice detail &amp; DOF. The light reflection is little distracting.</td>', 'Cool old machine. Nice detail & DOF. The light reflection is little distracting.', '2009-08-22 11:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620143, 814871, 28359, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty good, a tighter shot/angle/perspective is needed for this type of shot.</td>', 'The lighting is pretty good, a tighter shot/angle/perspective is needed for this type of shot.', '2009-08-22 11:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620144, 814126, 28359, '<td valign="top">What a small, nice reflection.</td>', 'What a small, nice reflection.', '2009-08-22 11:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620145, 814505, 28359, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter shot/crop, getting more smoke would had help a little in this shot.</td>', 'I think a tighter shot/crop, getting more smoke would had help a little in this shot.', '2009-08-22 11:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620146, 814705, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but maybe the wrong time of day to shoot. Pretty harsh lighting with the sun in the composition.</td>', 'Nice idea, but maybe the wrong time of day to shoot. Pretty harsh lighting with the sun in the composition.', '2009-08-22 11:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620147, 814726, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, it appears over sharpen or cropped real hard.</td>', 'Nice idea, it appears over sharpen or cropped real hard.', '2009-08-22 11:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620148, 814509, 28359, '<td valign="top">I think the light reflection is hurting this shot a little, good sharp dof/center focus.</td>', 'I think the light reflection is hurting this shot a little, good sharp dof/center focus.', '2009-08-22 11:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620149, 814273, 28359, '<td valign="top">Not a whole to the shot, it is what it is.</td>', 'Not a whole to the shot, it is what it is.', '2009-08-22 11:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620150, 814190, 28359, '<td valign="top">You should always try to use the max image size in a challenge, you get more detail in your image. I like the DOF use, the door as a leading line. But really to small to judge anything else. 4</td>', 'You should always try to use the max image size in a challenge, you get more detail in your image. I like the DOF use, the door as a leading line. But really to small to judge anything else. 4', '2009-08-22 11:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620151, 814723, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective here, but with the highkey kinda blown background area''s I think this might look a little better in B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like the perspective here, but with the highkey kinda blown background area''s I think this might look a little better in B&W.', '2009-08-22 11:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620152, 814899, 28359, '<td valign="top">What a mess..Lol.</td>', 'What a mess..Lol.', '2009-08-22 11:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620153, 814735, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the little twist the camera, but the shot is little to busy hard to find a focus point. Remember to use the max. image size allowed for a challenge.</td>', 'I like the little twist the camera, but the shot is little to busy hard to find a focus point. Remember to use the max. image size allowed for a challenge.', '2009-08-22 11:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620154, 814064, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the focus is on the knob yet the nob is out focus, some kind of flame would help add some additonal focus on to the upper half of the image.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the focus is on the knob yet the nob is out focus, some kind of flame would help add some additonal focus on to the upper half of the image.', '2009-08-22 11:52:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5620155, 813642, 28359, '<td valign="top">Just an ordinary picture of a microwave. Kind of noisy and out of focus. This type of shot usually doesnt do well. Maybe convert to B&amp;W,  rotate and crop tightly around the microwave.</td>', 'Just an ordinary picture of a microwave. Kind of noisy and out of focus. This type of shot usually doesnt do well. Maybe convert to B&W,  rotate and crop tightly around the microwave.', '2009-08-22 11:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620156, 814948, 28359, '<td valign="top">Other than the title I don''t see it</td>', 'Other than the title I don''t see it', '2009-08-22 11:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620157, 814755, 28359, '<td valign="top">I not seeing any kind of an appliance?</td>', 'I not seeing any kind of an appliance?', '2009-08-22 11:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620158, 814497, 28359, '<td valign="top">Not doubt this is what most of our refrigerators look like. As a photo, no real focus point, composition of the frig is good but shot just to busy and slightly out of focus. 3</td>', 'Not doubt this is what most of our refrigerators look like. As a photo, no real focus point, composition of the frig is good but shot just to busy and slightly out of focus. 3', '2009-08-22 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620182, 814955, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea--it grows on you the longer you look at it. My first impression was "dull". But as you stare at it, it starts to glow more... :D</td>', 'Interesting idea--it grows on you the longer you look at it. My first impression was "dull". But as you stare at it, it starts to glow more... :D', '2009-08-22 12:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620184, 814554, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Two things bother me a tad (they''re small, but I thought you might be interested...) The blurriness on the lower right portion of the appliance, and it seems like it''s cropped a little too tight on the top and bottom. Just a tad more breathing space would be nice.<br/> <br/>I like the black &amp; white with red feel!</td>', 'Very nice image. Two things bother me a tad (they''re small, but I thought you might be interested...) The blurriness on the lower right portion of the appliance, and it seems like it''s cropped a little too tight on the top and bottom. Just a tad more breathing space would be nice. I like the black & white with red feel!', '2009-08-22 12:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620185, 814505, 103142, '<td valign="top">The background is very distracting in this image. especially the weather stripping on the door (since it doesn''t lay flat). Interesting idea, but it think it would have done a lot better with a different background.</td>', 'The background is very distracting in this image. especially the weather stripping on the door (since it doesn''t lay flat). Interesting idea, but it think it would have done a lot better with a different background.', '2009-08-22 12:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620188, 814064, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like the picture and the idea. I think it would have been stronger with a little more space at the top and bottom. Especially on the bottom, the knob seems crowded. (I know it''s nit-picky, but it''s such a cool photo!)</td>', 'I really like the picture and the idea. I think it would have been stronger with a little more space at the top and bottom. Especially on the bottom, the knob seems crowded. (I know it''s nit-picky, but it''s such a cool photo!)', '2009-08-22 12:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620194, 814366, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I care that much for the picture. Perhaps it''s because there''s so much pattern to the carpet--I think a simpler carpet would have created a much stronger picture. And for some reason, the orange on the dirt devil is distracting (I would have been tempted to crop it off.) But I love the creativity! Excellent job of thinking outside the box and yet meeting the challenge! 7</td>', 'I''m not sure I care that much for the picture. Perhaps it''s because there''s so much pattern to the carpet--I think a simpler carpet would have created a much stronger picture. And for some reason, the orange on the dirt devil is distracting (I would have been tempted to crop it off.) But I love the creativity! Excellent job of thinking outside the box and yet meeting the challenge! 7', '2009-08-22 12:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620200, 814570, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well done. The toast seems a little overblown in the left. small, nit-picky thing: did you try from an angle more towards the front to add a little depth to the picture? 7</td>', 'Nice idea and well done. The toast seems a little overblown in the left. small, nit-picky thing: did you try from an angle more towards the front to add a little depth to the picture? 7', '2009-08-22 12:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620202, 814947, 103142, '<td valign="top">Like the picture quite a bit--seems a tad over-exposed?</td>', 'Like the picture quite a bit--seems a tad over-exposed?', '2009-08-22 12:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620203, 814153, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea--nice background. Not quite recognizable, imo...</td>', 'Interesting idea--nice background. Not quite recognizable, imo...', '2009-08-22 12:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620204, 814921, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t care much for the softness of the shot...<br/> <br/>voting later.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t care much for the softness of the shot... voting later.', '2009-08-22 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620205, 814190, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the wonderful angles, but I don''t see a need for the really shallow depth of field. I would have like this so much better more in focus.</td>', 'I like the idea and the wonderful angles, but I don''t see a need for the really shallow depth of field. I would have like this so much better more in focus.', '2009-08-22 12:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620211, 814853, 37845, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the best shots in the challenge. The part that really hooks me to this photo is the everyday feel to it... the walpaper, sink, utensils, and the desaturated look. Not sure I would blend fish, but makes for a great photo.</td>', 'I think this is one of the best shots in the challenge. The part that really hooks me to this photo is the everyday feel to it... the walpaper, sink, utensils, and the desaturated look. Not sure I would blend fish, but makes for a great photo.', '2009-08-22 12:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620212, 814959, 37845, '<td valign="top">Nice high contrast, and sharp image. The water adds to this shot nicely.</td>', 'Nice high contrast, and sharp image. The water adds to this shot nicely.', '2009-08-22 12:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620213, 813998, 37845, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites in this challenge. I like the shallow DOF, and the pastel colours. Not crazy about the border though, but that is just personal preference.</td>', 'One of my favourites in this challenge. I like the shallow DOF, and the pastel colours. Not crazy about the border though, but that is just personal preference.', '2009-08-22 12:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620232, 814882, 107410, '<td valign="top">I love the pattern and lines in this shot, but it just seems to be lacking impact.</td>', 'I love the pattern and lines in this shot, but it just seems to be lacking impact.', '2009-08-22 13:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620234, 814800, 107410, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; the blue really jumps out at me. My only issue is that you seem to have missed sharp focus by a hair. Or maybe the jpeg compression makes it seem that way...?</td>', 'Nice shot; the blue really jumps out at me. My only issue is that you seem to have missed sharp focus by a hair. Or maybe the jpeg compression makes it seem that way...?', '2009-08-22 13:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620237, 814215, 107410, '<td valign="top">This has a nice mysterious feel to  it which matches the title perfectly.</td>', 'This has a nice mysterious feel to  it which matches the title perfectly.', '2009-08-22 13:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620239, 814561, 107410, '<td valign="top">Although it appears that the crop was intentional, the fact that so little of each object was cut off makes it seem like a mistake and is very distracting to me. Also, I can''t quite find one spot that is sharp.</td>', 'Although it appears that the crop was intentional, the fact that so little of each object was cut off makes it seem like a mistake and is very distracting to me. Also, I can''t quite find one spot that is sharp.', '2009-08-22 13:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620242, 813536, 107410, '<td valign="top">The image is good, but the red apple appears to be very over processed. Also, the reflection on the backdrop is very distracting.</td>', 'The image is good, but the red apple appears to be very over processed. Also, the reflection on the backdrop is very distracting.', '2009-08-22 13:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620243, 814905, 107410, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but it just seems very sterile in my eyes. It is impactful, but just doesn''t speak to me, although I can''t place my finger on why. 7</td>', 'Interesting concept, but it just seems very sterile in my eyes. It is impactful, but just doesn''t speak to me, although I can''t place my finger on why. 7', '2009-08-22 13:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620247, 814497, 107410, '<td valign="top">This is kinda neat, it has a very old feel to it, like something that belongs in an old photo album. But I wish you would''ve got rid of all the "extra" stuff around it, like the towel, soda boxes, chips, etc... The refrigerator has so much going on as it is, everything else seems to throw the image into chaos.</td>', 'This is kinda neat, it has a very old feel to it, like something that belongs in an old photo album. But I wish you would''ve got rid of all the "extra" stuff around it, like the towel, soda boxes, chips, etc... The refrigerator has so much going on as it is, everything else seems to throw the image into chaos.', '2009-08-22 13:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620314, 814191, 37845, '<td valign="top">Haahahah... hahah.... thats a messy joke :D</td>', 'Haahahah... hahah.... thats a messy joke :D', '2009-08-22 15:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620316, 814955, 37845, '<td valign="top">By the glow on the microwave itself, I am assuming you used a blacklight and glow in the dark paint. Either way, looking forward to how you did this.</td>', 'By the glow on the microwave itself, I am assuming you used a blacklight and glow in the dark paint. Either way, looking forward to how you did this.', '2009-08-22 15:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620317, 814940, 37845, '<td valign="top">This unique perspective makes this photo stand out from what could have been a very ordinary picture of a fridge</td>', 'This unique perspective makes this photo stand out from what could have been a very ordinary picture of a fridge', '2009-08-22 15:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620338, 814951, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the angle here.  The DOF works well.  The tones are a little flat with few solid whites and blacks.</td>', 'I like the angle here.  The DOF works well.  The tones are a little flat with few solid whites and blacks.', '2009-08-22 16:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620340, 814731, 91496, '<td valign="top">Hot photo!  I like the glow of the red against the black.  Subject is kind of static.</td>', 'Hot photo!  I like the glow of the red against the black.  Subject is kind of static.', '2009-08-22 16:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620341, 814106, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and a play on words (although hand mixer might make more sense).  Not sure I understand why the colors are present.  DOF might be too narrow as the focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'Interesting idea and a play on words (although hand mixer might make more sense).  Not sure I understand why the colors are present.  DOF might be too narrow as the focus seems a little soft.', '2009-08-22 16:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620343, 814755, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interesting angles and juxtoposition of colors and textures.  Not sure it really works for me.  I am also missing the appliance connection.  Not sure I understand the title either.</td>', 'Interesting angles and juxtoposition of colors and textures.  Not sure it really works for me.  I am also missing the appliance connection.  Not sure I understand the title either.', '2009-08-22 16:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620348, 814930, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.   Although I think maybe have having the ground coffee coming out the grinder would have been cool.  Reflection is great, showing the kitchen.  The beans seems dusty or blurred, more empasiss on them would have had greater impact.</td>', 'Nice composition.   Although I think maybe have having the ground coffee coming out the grinder would have been cool.  Reflection is great, showing the kitchen.  The beans seems dusty or blurred, more empasiss on them would have had greater impact.', '2009-08-22 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620352, 814899, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is so interesting to look at.  The composition is spot on, with the mess flowing into the left hand side.  The lighting is very nice as well. I do think the mess is however messy, and not as photogenic as other subjects.</td>', 'Wow, this is so interesting to look at.  The composition is spot on, with the mess flowing into the left hand side.  The lighting is very nice as well. I do think the mess is however messy, and not as photogenic as other subjects.', '2009-08-22 16:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620355, 814957, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like how the shadows/lighting makes another set of circles around the burner.  Composition might be a little too centered, perhaps a little more space around the burner would have lessoned that.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like how the shadows/lighting makes another set of circles around the burner.  Composition might be a little too centered, perhaps a little more space around the burner would have lessoned that.', '2009-08-22 16:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620361, 814497, 91496, '<td valign="top">Kind of an ordinary scene.  Focus is off.  The subject is not really isolated enough, as there is so much clutter in and around it.</td>', 'Kind of an ordinary scene.  Focus is off.  The subject is not really isolated enough, as there is so much clutter in and around it.', '2009-08-22 16:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620364, 814153, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great gradient going on with the orange backdrop, nicely done.  The shape of the keetle does not really appeal to me.  Also, without your title I would not have known what is was.</td>', 'Great gradient going on with the orange backdrop, nicely done.  The shape of the keetle does not really appeal to me.  Also, without your title I would not have known what is was.', '2009-08-22 16:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
