(5620369, 814921, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the diagonals of the blender and the red milk(?).  The shapes of the milk are fantastic.  The blur (focus/motion) is a distraction.  Not sure if it was intentional or not.</td>', 'I like the composition with the diagonals of the blender and the red milk(?).  The shapes of the milk are fantastic.  The blur (focus/motion) is a distraction.  Not sure if it was intentional or not.', '2009-08-22 17:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620373, 814163, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the cord trailing off like some tail of an animal.  The DOF on the cord is nice as well.  The reflection is great, although the raised metal design in the toaster messes wiht the effect in a bad way.</td>', 'I like the composition with the cord trailing off like some tail of an animal.  The DOF on the cord is nice as well.  The reflection is great, although the raised metal design in the toaster messes wiht the effect in a bad way.', '2009-08-22 17:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620377, 814215, 91496, '<td valign="top">"Extreme Vacuuming" - Coming to the Home and Garden Channel soon.  I like the lighting and how you set up the vacuum. although the black void in the middle is a bit of an distraction.  The reflection is intersting but I am not sure whether it adds or subtracts from the composition.</td>', '"Extreme Vacuuming" - Coming to the Home and Garden Channel soon.  I like the lighting and how you set up the vacuum. although the black void in the middle is a bit of an distraction.  The reflection is intersting but I am not sure whether it adds or subtracts from the composition.', '2009-08-22 17:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620382, 814682, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and all the cool textures.  Thr DOF works well here and could even have been pushed a little farther.  I am not sure about the square crop, did you try a portrait crop with more the top of the machine showing?</td>', 'I like the lighting and all the cool textures.  Thr DOF works well here and could even have been pushed a little farther.  I am not sure about the square crop, did you try a portrait crop with more the top of the machine showing?', '2009-08-22 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620424, 813536, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of all the colors and the bieges.  Lighting is a bit harsh.  A pure color backdrop may have added more isolation and impact.</td>', 'I like the contrast of all the colors and the bieges.  Lighting is a bit harsh.  A pure color backdrop may have added more isolation and impact.', '2009-08-22 18:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620425, 814925, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the comosition and the humor.  I like the lighting.  That said the pose of the cat is kind of odd with the front body and feet hidden.</td>', 'I like the comosition and the humor.  I like the lighting.  That said the pose of the cat is kind of odd with the front body and feet hidden.', '2009-08-22 18:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620427, 814279, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice macro of the bristles.  Good use of DOF.  Mine never look this clean.  I think a crop that just had the green plastic as the frame boundaries would have been a stonger composition.</td>', 'Nice macro of the bristles.  Good use of DOF.  Mine never look this clean.  I think a crop that just had the green plastic as the frame boundaries would have been a stonger composition.', '2009-08-22 18:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620428, 814190, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice viewpoint with the light and dark areas of the photo.  The DOF works well for this.  Something about the angle is offputting to me.  Perhaps the inside of the fridge could have been mad square to the frame, perhaps not.</td>', 'Nice viewpoint with the light and dark areas of the photo.  The DOF works well for this.  Something about the angle is offputting to me.  Perhaps the inside of the fridge could have been mad square to the frame, perhaps not.', '2009-08-22 18:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620429, 814757, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion, especially the placement of the mug.  Nie B&amp;W tones, with solid blacks and whites.  The DOF is a bit too shallow.  I think I would have preferred the reflections on the top parts to be sharper from more DOF.</td>', 'Nice compostion, especially the placement of the mug.  Nie B&W tones, with solid blacks and whites.  The DOF is a bit too shallow.  I think I would have preferred the reflections on the top parts to be sharper from more DOF.', '2009-08-22 18:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5620432, 814366, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool ideas and I do like all the wild colors.  There is an abstract quality that is kind of neat.  The composition needs something as the dirt devel tip ends up totally centered.  The DOF is a bit narrow as well.  Did you try any with wider DOF to see what the effect is?</td>', 'Cool ideas and I do like all the wild colors.  There is an abstract quality that is kind of neat.  The composition needs something as the dirt devel tip ends up totally centered.  The DOF is a bit narrow as well.  Did you try any with wider DOF to see what the effect is?', '2009-08-22 18:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
