(5620434, 814940, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I had to think for a few seconds to identify it.  Nice balance or colors/tones between the grilles/floor and the counter/walls.  White highlight thingy is a distraction.  A crop containing the bottom 2/3 is worth looking at.</td>', 'Nice.  I had to think for a few seconds to identify it.  Nice balance or colors/tones between the grilles/floor and the counter/walls.  White highlight thingy is a distraction.  A crop containing the bottom 2/3 is worth looking at.', '2009-08-22 18:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
