(5620553, 814366, 100335, '<td valign="top">Haha, nice idea, i like how the colored (whatever they are) have a panning blur. The composition works here i won''t be a rule of 3rds whore. My nitpick for this image is that the devil looks slightly oversharpened. I''m guessing because it was difficult to get it in focus while moving.</td>', 'Haha, nice idea, i like how the colored (whatever they are) have a panning blur. The composition works here i won''t be a rule of 3rds whore. My nitpick for this image is that the devil looks slightly oversharpened. I''m guessing because it was difficult to get it in focus while moving.', '2009-08-22 21:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
