(5622074, 814871, 107827, '<td valign="top">A bit weak. Some ideas: Off center it, or maybe only a portion of it to create intrigue. <br/> <br/>Pull it to the edge of the counter, then stoop down and shoot upward; I see you were at the counter edge... the drama didn''t happen in this short shot. <br/> <br/>Limit the depth of field (how much is in focus) so there it helps it to stand out. <br/> <br/>Centered is usually not a big impact... neither is the equal spacing all the way around. <br/> <br/>Hope these stir up some creative juices!</td>', 'A bit weak. Some ideas: Off center it, or maybe only a portion of it to create intrigue.  Pull it to the edge of the counter, then stoop down and shoot upward; I see you were at the counter edge... the drama didn''t happen in this short shot.  Limit the depth of field (how much is in focus) so there it helps it to stand out.  Centered is usually not a big impact... neither is the equal spacing all the way around.  Hope these stir up some creative juices!', '2009-08-24 15:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
