(5624010, 814947, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ahh you win, right?  :D  I almost commented on this during the challenge but I ran out of time (I''m such a procrastinator).  I was going to say that I am laughing at the equipment because I have not seen anything like this in a long time!  I love her expression - it''s adorable.  The only thing that did not connect with me was why this was an outdoor scene.  But I''m guessing that does not matter :)  Cute shot!</td>', 'Ahh you win, right?  :D  I almost commented on this during the challenge but I ran out of time (I''m such a procrastinator).  I was going to say that I am laughing at the equipment because I have not seen anything like this in a long time!  I love her expression - it''s adorable.  The only thing that did not connect with me was why this was an outdoor scene.  But I''m guessing that does not matter :)  Cute shot!', '2009-08-26 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
