(5624026, 814959, 89723, '<td valign="top">I''m totally stoked!! A HUGE thanks to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=20577" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Toddhead</a> for letting me use his lights even though now I have more BLUE ribbons than he does. Can''t wait to see him at work tomorrow! (My way of getting him to start shooting again.) <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the comments. The blender survived and it wasn''t very difficult just had to be super fast so my hand wasn''t in the shot when I started the blender.</td>', 'I''m totally stoked!! A HUGE thanks to  Toddhead for letting me use his lights even though now I have more BLUE ribbons than he does. Can''t wait to see him at work tomorrow! (My way of getting him to start shooting again.)  Thanks for all the comments. The blender survived and it wasn''t very difficult just had to be super fast so my hand wasn''t in the shot when I started the blender.', '2009-08-26 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 0),
