(5624038, 814570, 18563, '<td valign="top">Wow! Thanks for all the votes and comments!!! <br/> <br/>Setup:<br/>The toast was held up by two pieces of fishing line by my daughter. After about 20 shots she told me her arms felt like they were about to fall off (thanks for all the hard work Kaylee!!) The lighting was from 2 Alienbees B800''s on either side.</td>', 'Wow! Thanks for all the votes and comments!!!  Setup:The toast was held up by two pieces of fishing line by my daughter. After about 20 shots she told me her arms felt like they were about to fall off (thanks for all the hard work Kaylee!!) The lighting was from 2 Alienbees B800''s on either side.', '2009-08-26 01:15:48.000000', NULL, 0),
